{"seq":1,"slug":"monorepo-structure","title":"Monorepo 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/monorepo-structure","wordCount":815,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"monorepo-架构\">Monorepo 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo（单一代码仓库）是一种将多个相关项目放在同一个 Git 仓库中管理的代码组织策略。与传统的 Polyrepo（每个项目一个仓库）不同，Monorepo 让团队在一个统一的代码库中共享代码、管理依赖、协调发布。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Polyrepo&#10;        R1[repo: web-app]&#10;        R2[repo: mobile-app]&#10;        R3[repo: shared-utils]&#10;        R4[repo: ui-components]&#10;        R5[repo: api-client]&#10;        R1 -.-&gt;|npm install| R3&#10;        R1 -.-&gt;|npm install| R4&#10;        R2 -.-&gt;|npm install| R3&#10;        R2 -.-&gt;|npm install| R5&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Monorepo&#10;        M[repo: frontend-platform]&#10;        M --&gt; P1[packages/web-app]&#10;        M --&gt; P2[packages/mobile-app]&#10;        M --&gt; P3[packages/shared-utils]&#10;        M --&gt; P4[packages/ui-components]&#10;        M --&gt; P5[packages/api-client]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Polyrepo\n        R1[repo: web-app]\n        R2[repo: mobile-app]\n        R3[repo: shared-utils]\n        R4[repo: ui-components]\n        R5[repo: api-client]\n        R1 -.-&gt;|npm install| R3\n        R1 -.-&gt;|npm install| R4\n        R2 -.-&gt;|npm install| R3\n        R2 -.-&gt;|npm install| R5\n    end\n    subgraph Monorepo\n        M[repo: frontend-platform]\n        M --&gt; P1[packages/web-app]\n        M --&gt; P2[packages/mobile-app]\n        M --&gt; P3[packages/shared-utils]\n        M --&gt; P4[packages/ui-components]\n        M --&gt; P5[packages/api-client]\n    end</pre><p>Google、Meta、Microsoft 等科技巨头都在大规模使用 Monorepo。在前端领域，React、Vue、Babel、Next.js 等开源项目同样采用了 Monorepo 的组织方式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-的核心优势\">Monorepo 的核心优势</h2><h3 id=\"代码共享与复用\">代码共享与复用</h3><p>在 Monorepo 中，共享代码不需要发布到 npm，直接通过 workspace 协议引用即可。修改共享代码后，所有依赖它的项目立即生效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myapp/web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myapp/shared-utils&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myapp/ui-components&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myapp/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myapp/shared-utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myapp/ui-components\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"原子化提交\">原子化提交</h3><p>当一个变更涉及多个包时，可以在一次 commit 中完成所有修改。不需要在多个仓库之间协调版本，不需要先发布依赖包再更新消费方。</p>\n<h3 id=\"统一的工具链配置\">统一的工具链配置</h3><p>ESLint、TypeScript、Prettier 等工具的配置可以在根级别统一管理，各个包继承并按需覆盖。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"monorepo-root/&#10;├── .eslintrc.js          # 统一 ESLint 配置&#10;├── tsconfig.base.json    # 基础 TypeScript 配置&#10;├── biome.json            # 统一 Biome 配置&#10;└── packages/&#10;    ├── web-app/&#10;    │   └── tsconfig.json # 继承 base，添加 React 支持&#10;    └── server/&#10;        └── tsconfig.json # 继承 base，添加 Node.js 类型\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>monorepo-root/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── .eslintrc.js          # 统一 ESLint 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tsconfig.base.json    # 基础 TypeScript 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── biome.json            # 统一 Biome 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── web-app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── tsconfig.json # 继承 base，添加 React 支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── server/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── tsconfig.json # 继承 base，添加 Node.js 类型</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"pnpm-workspace-实践\">pnpm Workspace 实践</h2><p>pnpm 是目前 Monorepo 场景中最受推荐的包管理器。它的 workspace 功能原生支持多包管理，硬链接机制大幅节省磁盘空间，严格的依赖隔离机制避免了幽灵依赖问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;packages:&#10;  - &#39;apps/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;packages/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;tools/*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tools/*'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"典型目录结构\">典型目录结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-frontend-platform/&#10;├── pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;├── package.json&#10;├── turbo.json&#10;├── tsconfig.base.json&#10;├── apps/&#10;│   ├── web/                  # 主站 Web 应用&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   ├── admin/                # 后台管理系统&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   └── docs/                 # 文档站点&#10;│       ├── package.json&#10;│       └── src/&#10;├── packages/&#10;│   ├── ui/                   # 共享 UI 组件库&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   ├── shared/               # 共享工具函数&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── src/&#10;│   └── api-client/           # API 客户端&#10;│       ├── package.json&#10;│       └── src/&#10;└── tools/&#10;    ├── eslint-config/        # 共享 ESLint 配置&#10;    │   └── package.json&#10;    └── tsconfig/             # 共享 TypeScript 配置&#10;        └── package.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-frontend-platform/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── turbo.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tsconfig.base.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── web/                  # 主站 Web 应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── admin/                # 后台管理系统</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── docs/                 # 文档站点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ui/                   # 共享 UI 组件库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── shared/               # 共享工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── api-client/           # API 客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── tools/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── eslint-config/        # 共享 ESLint 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── tsconfig/             # 共享 TypeScript 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── package.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常用命令\">常用命令</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装所有依赖&#10;pnpm install&#10;&#10;# 在特定包中运行命令&#10;pnpm --filter @myapp/web dev&#10;pnpm --filter @myapp/ui build&#10;&#10;# 在所有包中运行构建&#10;pnpm -r run build&#10;&#10;# 添加依赖到特定包&#10;pnpm --filter @myapp/web add react-router&#10;pnpm --filter @myapp/web add -D @types/react&#10;&#10;# 添加工作区内部包依赖&#10;pnpm --filter @myapp/web add @myapp/ui@workspace:*\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装所有依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在特定包中运行命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myapp/web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myapp/ui</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在所有包中运行构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加依赖到特定包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myapp/web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> react-router</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myapp/web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @types/react</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加工作区内部包依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myapp/web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myapp/ui@workspace:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"turborepo-构建编排\">Turborepo 构建编排</h2><p>Turborepo 是专为 Monorepo 设计的高性能构建系统。它通过任务依赖图、增量构建和远程缓存，大幅提升多包构建的效率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://turbo.build/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;, &quot;.next/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;persistent&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: false&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://turbo.build/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".next/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"persistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 构建依赖图&#10;        UI_BUILD[&quot;@myapp/ui build&quot;]&#10;        SHARED_BUILD[&quot;@myapp/shared build&quot;]&#10;        API_BUILD[&quot;@myapp/api-client build&quot;]&#10;        WEB_BUILD[&quot;@myapp/web build&quot;]&#10;        ADMIN_BUILD[&quot;@myapp/admin build&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    SHARED_BUILD --&gt; UI_BUILD&#10;    SHARED_BUILD --&gt; API_BUILD&#10;    UI_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD&#10;    API_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD&#10;    UI_BUILD --&gt; ADMIN_BUILD&#10;    API_BUILD --&gt; ADMIN_BUILD\">graph LR\n    subgraph 构建依赖图\n        UI_BUILD[\"@myapp/ui build\"]\n        SHARED_BUILD[\"@myapp/shared build\"]\n        API_BUILD[\"@myapp/api-client build\"]\n        WEB_BUILD[\"@myapp/web build\"]\n        ADMIN_BUILD[\"@myapp/admin build\"]\n    end\n    SHARED_BUILD --&gt; UI_BUILD\n    SHARED_BUILD --&gt; API_BUILD\n    UI_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD\n    API_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD\n    UI_BUILD --&gt; ADMIN_BUILD\n    API_BUILD --&gt; ADMIN_BUILD</pre><p>Turborepo 的 <code>^build</code> 语法表示&quot;先构建所有依赖的包&quot;。上图中，<code>@myapp/web</code> 的构建会自动等待 <code>@myapp/ui</code> 和 <code>@myapp/api-client</code> 构建完成。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"包的划分原则\">包的划分原则</h2><p>合理的包划分是 Monorepo 成功的关键。划分过细会增加管理成本，划分过粗则失去了模块化的意义。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>划分维度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>可独立部署的终端产物</td>\n<td>web-app、admin、mobile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件层</td>\n<td>可复用的 UI 组件</td>\n<td>ui-components、icons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑层</td>\n<td>可复用的业务/工具逻辑</td>\n<td>shared-utils、api-client</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置层</td>\n<td>共享的工具链配置</td>\n<td>eslint-config、tsconfig</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 应用层&#10;        APP1[apps/web]&#10;        APP2[apps/admin]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 组件层&#10;        UI[packages/ui]&#10;        ICONS[packages/icons]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 逻辑层&#10;        SHARED[packages/shared]&#10;        API[packages/api-client]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 配置层&#10;        ESLINT[tools/eslint-config]&#10;        TS[tools/tsconfig]&#10;    end&#10;    APP1 --&gt; UI&#10;    APP1 --&gt; API&#10;    APP2 --&gt; UI&#10;    APP2 --&gt; API&#10;    UI --&gt; SHARED&#10;    UI --&gt; ICONS&#10;    API --&gt; SHARED\">graph TD\n    subgraph 应用层\n        APP1[apps/web]\n        APP2[apps/admin]\n    end\n    subgraph 组件层\n        UI[packages/ui]\n        ICONS[packages/icons]\n    end\n    subgraph 逻辑层\n        SHARED[packages/shared]\n        API[packages/api-client]\n    end\n    subgraph 配置层\n        ESLINT[tools/eslint-config]\n        TS[tools/tsconfig]\n    end\n    APP1 --&gt; UI\n    APP1 --&gt; API\n    APP2 --&gt; UI\n    APP2 --&gt; API\n    UI --&gt; SHARED\n    UI --&gt; ICONS\n    API --&gt; SHARED</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-的挑战与应对\">Monorepo 的挑战与应对</h2><h3 id=\"仓库体积增长\">仓库体积增长</h3><p>随着包数量增长，Git 仓库体积会持续增大。解决方案包括 Git 浅克隆（shallow clone）、Git LFS 管理大文件，以及合理的 <code>.gitignore</code> 配置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CI 中使用浅克隆加速&#10;git clone --depth 1 --filter=blob:none https://github.com/org/monorepo.git\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 中使用浅克隆加速</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=blob:none</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/monorepo.git</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"构建速度优化\">构建速度优化</h3><p>利用 Turborepo 的远程缓存和增量构建能力，避免重复构建未变更的包。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 启用远程缓存&#10;npx turbo login&#10;npx turbo link&#10;&#10;# 只构建受影响的包&#10;npx turbo run build --filter=...[HEAD~1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用远程缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只构建受影响的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=...[HEAD~1]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"权限控制\">权限控制</h3><p>在大团队中，可能需要限制某些团队只能修改特定的包。GitHub 的 CODEOWNERS 文件可以实现路径级别的审核控制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# CODEOWNERS&#10;/apps/web/          @frontend-team&#10;/apps/admin/        @admin-team&#10;/packages/ui/       @design-system-team&#10;/packages/shared/   @platform-team\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># CODEOWNERS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/apps/web/          @frontend-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/apps/admin/        @admin-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/packages/ui/       @design-system-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/packages/shared/   @platform-team</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Monorepo 通过统一仓库管理多个相关项目，实现代码共享、原子化提交和统一工具链。</li>\n<li>pnpm workspace 是目前最推荐的 Monorepo 包管理方案，硬链接和严格依赖隔离是其核心优势。</li>\n<li>Turborepo 通过任务依赖图和增量缓存优化多包构建效率。</li>\n<li>包的划分遵循&quot;应用层—组件层—逻辑层—配置层&quot;的分层原则。</li>\n<li>Monorepo 的挑战主要在于仓库体积、构建速度和权限控制，都有成熟的应对方案。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Monorepo 架构","id":"monorepo-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 的核心优势","id":"monorepo-的核心优势"},{"level":3,"text":"代码共享与复用","id":"代码共享与复用"},{"level":3,"text":"原子化提交","id":"原子化提交"},{"level":3,"text":"统一的工具链配置","id":"统一的工具链配置"},{"level":2,"text":"pnpm Workspace 实践","id":"pnpm-workspace-实践"},{"level":3,"text":"基础配置","id":"基础配置"},{"level":3,"text":"典型目录结构","id":"典型目录结构"},{"level":3,"text":"常用命令","id":"常用命令"},{"level":2,"text":"Turborepo 构建编排","id":"turborepo-构建编排"},{"level":2,"text":"包的划分原则","id":"包的划分原则"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 的挑战与应对","id":"monorepo-的挑战与应对"},{"level":3,"text":"仓库体积增长","id":"仓库体积增长"},{"level":3,"text":"构建速度优化","id":"构建速度优化"},{"level":3,"text":"权限控制","id":"权限控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"框架选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/framework-selection"}}